        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana HRC175, Light Duty Solid Brass Handrail Bracket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLight duty bracket used to support stair handrails. A solid brass handrail bracket, it has a large round shape base and a 3\" projection off wall. Large 2-5/16\" round wall mounting base for good support. Packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HRC175_size.gif?v=1704354762\" width=\"528\" height=\"220\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana HRC175 dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-heavy-duty-handrail-bracket-deltana-hrc253\"><b>Heavy Duty Handrail Bracket</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana HRC175 Handrail Bracket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HRC175.pdf?v=1704262162\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana HRC175 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
