                "title": "Solid Brass Light Duty Handrail Bracket",
                "description": "Light Duty Solid Brass Hand Rail Bracket Deltana HRC175 - Light duty bracket used to support stair hand rails. A solid brass hand rail bracket, it has a large round shape base and a 3 inch projection off wall. Large 2-5/16 inch round wall mounting base for good support. Packaged with mounting hardware. Available in your choice of 9 finish colors.",
